---
import MikoBadge from "./MikoBadge.astro";
const setupPrompt = `Set up Miko for me. Do these in order.

First, install the setup skills by running this in the terminal:
npx skills add mikoagents/miko -g

Then run /miko-setup in this chat. Guide me through the rest: check prerequisites, install Miko from source, connect my coding credentials, add my repositories, and help me launch it. I will sign in and approve access when you ask.`;
---

<section id="get-started">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--site-content-width)] px-4 pt-24 pb-16 sm:px-6 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-xl flex-col gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">Get Miko running.</h2>
        <p class="text-theme-text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">One prompt for your agent. Then your first task, and the logs on the board.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="quickstart-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="quickstart-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium">Paste this to your agent</h3>
            <p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Copy it into Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, or your coding agent. It tells the agent what to do first, then what to do next.</p>
            <div class="quickstart-command"><code>{setupPrompt}</code><button type="button" data-copy-command aria-label="Copy setup prompt">Copy</button></div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="quickstart-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
          <div><h3 class="text-base font-medium">Give Miko its first task</h3><p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assign a Linear issue, or <MikoBadge /> in a configured GitHub PR, GitLab MR, or Slack conversation.</p><p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Keep the worker and any tunnel running so new tasks can reach Miko.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="quickstart-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium">Read the logs on the board</h3>
            <p class="text-theme-text-muted mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Open this address on the machine running Miko. Select the task and follow its live log.</p>
            <div class="quickstart-command"><code>http://127.0.0.1:3456/board</code><button type="button" data-copy-command="http://127.0.0.1:3456/board" data-copy-status="Board address copied." aria-label="Copy board address">Copy</button></div>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-theme-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">Installing the skills adds the setup workflow. Running <code>/miko-setup</code> installs the runtime. You sign in and approve access to your accounts during setup.</p>
      <p class="quickstart-status text-theme-text-muted text-xs" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-theme-accent hover:bg-theme-accent-hover text-theme-accent-contrast h-11 px-6 text-sm" href="https://github.com/mikoagents/miko#self-hosted-setup">Read the quick start ↗</a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-theme-card-03-hex text-theme-text h-11 px-6 text-sm" href="https://github.com/mikoagents/miko/blob/main/docs/SELF_HOSTING.md">Manual setup ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.quickstart-steps { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; display:grid; gap:28px; }
.quickstart-steps > li { display:grid; grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr); gap:16px; }
.quickstart-number { display:grid; place-items:center; width:28px; height:28px; border:1px solid var(--color-theme-border); border-radius:50%; font-size:12px; }
.quickstart-command { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px; width:100%; margin:16px 0 0; padding:16px; background:var(--color-theme-card-03-hex); border:1px solid var(--color-theme-border); border-radius:12px; box-sizing:border-box; }
.quickstart-command code { flex:1; min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; white-space:pre-wrap; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; }
.quickstart-command button { flex-shrink:0; font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; padding:4px; }
.quickstart-status:empty { display:none; }
@media(max-width:639px) { .quickstart-steps > li { gap:12px; } .quickstart-command { padding:12px; gap:8px; } .quickstart-command code { font-size:12px; } }
</style>
